# Lumenhold Academy — 简体中文 (zh-CN) translation of content/events/chain_timeloop.grim
# Maintained by `node tools/grim.js i18n zh-CN`. Translate the text after "="; keep {tokens}.
# "# en:" shows the English source. [hash] marks the English version a line was translated from;
# lines marked STALE need updating — after fixing the text, delete the [hash] and re-run the tool.


@event timeloop_exploit
# en: Every Bet, Every Answer
title [082f70] = 每一场赌，每一道题
# en: {loop_exploit == 0: You know which way every coin will fall, and what's on this afternoon's quiz.|{loop_exploit == 1: The bets again. Your classmates are starting to look at you oddly when you win.|The bets, the quiz, the same faces losing. Their groans have stopped being funny.}} {~The quiz is on the founders.|A fourth-year bets you can't name every tower.|Someone bets on which way the prefect will fall.}
text [0a1a07] = {loop_exploit == 0: 每一枚硬币会落向哪面，今天下午的小测考什么，你都知道。|{loop_exploit == 1: 又是那些赌局。你赢的时候，同学们开始用奇怪的眼神看你了。|赌局、小测、同样输掉的面孔。他们的哀叹已经不好笑了。}} {~小测考的是创始者。|一个四年级生跟你打赌，说你叫不全每一座塔的名字。|有人赌级长会往哪边摔。}
# en: A student at the centre of a crowd in the courtyard collecting coins from groaning classmates, a quiz paper marked full marks in their other hand.
scene [a57222] = 庭院里，一个学生被人群围在中间，从哀叹的同学手里收着硬币，另一只手拿着一张满分的小测卷。
# en: Take everything you can
opt.left.label [0c2b42] = 能拿的全拿
# en: You win it all again, and the winning has a taste like tin. The loop tightens: the morning is shorter now, the edges closer. And someone is watching you across the courtyard as if they know.
opt.left.say.1 [4bf76c] = 你又赢了个精光，胜利的滋味像锡。循环收紧了：早晨更短了，边缘更近了。而庭院对面有人正看着你，好像知道些什么。
# en: {~The coins are real when you wake, and the marks stay in the ledger. So does the hollow feeling, a little deeper each time.|You win again. The crowns carry over into the next Tuesday. So does the weight of them.}
opt.left.say.2 [06c77f] = {~醒来时硬币是真的，分数也留在成绩册上。那种空落落的感觉也留着，每次都更深一点。|你又赢了。金币带进了下一个星期二。它们的分量也是。}
# en: Just the quiz, then stop
opt.right.label [938eb6] = 只做小测，然后收手
# en: {~Full marks, and nothing else. It's a small cheat, and it still sits badly at supper.|You ace the quiz and leave the bets alone. A small mercy, to yourself mostly.}
opt.right.say.1 [0da1de] = {~满分，别的什么都不要。这只是个小小的作弊，晚饭时还是让你不舒服。|你考了满分，没碰那些赌局。一点小小的仁慈，主要是对你自己。}

@event timeloop_noticed
# en: "You've Done This Before"
title [54cfff] = “你以前做过这个”
# en: Seraphine catches your sleeve in the corridor. Her eyes are very clear. "You've done this before," she says. "Today. Many times. I can see the creases in it." She doesn't let go. "Whatever you're taking from it, it's taking from you too."
text [1b521a] = 瑟拉芬在走廊里拉住你的袖子。她的眼睛非常清澈。“你以前做过这个，”她说。“今天。很多次。我能看见它上面的折痕。”她没有松手。“不管你从里面拿走了什么，它也在从你身上拿走东西。”
# en: A seer catching a student's sleeve in a crowded corridor, her eyes very clear, the other students blurred around them as if moving too fast.
scene [9ea92b] = 一位预言者在拥挤的走廊里拉住一个学生的袖子，她的眼睛非常清澈，周围的学生模糊成一片，仿佛走得太快。
# en: Tell her everything
opt.left.label [92d56a] = 全都告诉她
# en: You tell her, all of it, in a window seat. She listens and then says, "Ask the clocks in the astronomy tower." Tomorrow she won't remember. Today, she holds your hand like she will.
opt.left.say.1 [a61455] = 你在一个窗边座位上把一切都告诉了她。她听完说：“去问天文塔里的钟。”明天她就不会记得了。今天，她握着你的手，就像她会记得一样。
# en: Pull away
opt.right.label [1414c0] = 挣开
# en: You pull free and walk fast. She doesn't follow. "I'll forget this," she calls after you. "You won't." She's right, and that's the worst of it.
opt.right.say.1 [8fd623] = 你挣脱开，快步走开。她没有追上来。“我会忘了这件事，”她在你身后喊。“你不会。”她说得对，这才是最糟的。

@event timeloop_dare_confess
# en: Things You'd Never Say
title [06d735] = 永远说不出口的话
# en: {Nothing today will last. So you find the person you've never told, and you tell them.|Another Tuesday, another confession nobody will remember.|You've confessed to them three times now, three different ways.} {They look at you as if you've handed them something breakable.|They laugh, kindly, then don't.|They take a long time to answer.}
text [b12772] = {今天的一切都不会留下。于是你找到那个你从没告诉过的人，告诉了 TA。|又一个星期二，又一次没人会记得的告白。|你已经向 TA 告白了三次，三种不同的说法。} {TA 看着你，仿佛你递给了 TA 一件易碎的东西。|TA 笑了，很温柔，然后不笑了。|TA 过了很久才回答。}
# en: Two students in an empty corridor at dusk, one mid-sentence with their heart on their sleeve, the other's face caught between surprise and joy.
scene [76e15b] = 黄昏空荡的走廊里，两个学生，一个正把心里话说到一半，另一个的脸定格在惊讶与喜悦之间。
# en: Say it all, properly
opt.left.label [7d3c43] = 好好地，全说出来
# en: {You say all of it. They say something back that you'll keep for the rest of your life, and they'll have forgotten by breakfast. It's the most bittersweet thing you've ever done.|They kiss you, or hug you, or cry; it's different each time. By morning it never happened. Only you know.}
opt.left.say.1 [521188] = {你全说了。TA 回了你一句你会记一辈子的话，而到早餐时 TA 就会忘掉。这是你做过的最苦乐参半的事。|TA 吻了你，或者抱了你，或者哭了；每次都不一样。到了早上，什么都没发生过。只有你知道。}
# en: Say it badly, on purpose
opt.right.label [a92326] = 故意说得很糟
# en: {You make a terrible speech, as a rehearsal. They're baffled. You learn exactly which words you'd use if this were real, and file them away.|You stumble through it, and practise, and stumble less. One Tuesday you'll say it on a Wednesday.}
opt.right.say.1 [1c97a1] = {你发表了一通糟糕透顶的演讲，当作彩排。TA 一头雾水。你弄清了如果这是真的，你会用哪些词，把它们收好。|你磕磕绊绊地说完，练习，再说得少磕绊一点。总有一个星期二，你会在星期三把它说出来。}

@event timeloop_dare_fall
# en: Off the Observatory Roof
title [44cb45] = 从观星台屋顶跳下
# en: {If nothing lasts, then nothing can hurt for long. You climb the observatory parapet with the whole lake below you.|The parapet again. You know exactly how the wind feels at the top.|You've done this before. You still can't quite believe you do it.} {The lake is very blue.|Gulls wheel below you.|The bell in the tower is about to ring.}
text [e67a8a] = {如果什么都留不下，那就没有什么能疼很久。你爬上观星台的护墙，整座湖就在你脚下。|又是护墙。你清楚地知道顶上的风是什么感觉。|你以前做过这个。你仍然不太相信自己会做。} {湖水很蓝。|海鸥在你脚下盘旋。|塔里的钟就要敲响了。}
# en: A student standing on the observatory parapet with arms wide, the lake far below, the morning sky enormous.
scene [6e1128] = 一个学生张开双臂站在观星台的护墙上，湖在很远的下方，清晨的天空无比辽阔。
# en: Jump
opt.left.label [1ef32d] = 跳
# en: {You fall for a long, bright moment, and the lake rushes up, and you wake in your bed to the smell of eggs. Your heart is still pounding. It was glorious, and you'll never do it again. You'll do it again.|You hit the water like a bell. Then: eggs, sunlight, your own bed. You laugh out loud at breakfast and the prefect stares.}
opt.left.say.1 [165cdb] = {你下坠了一个漫长而明亮的瞬间，湖面扑面而来，然后你在床上醒来，闻到鸡蛋的味道。心还在狂跳。这太壮丽了，你再也不会这么做了。你还会再做的。|你像一口钟一样撞进水里。然后：鸡蛋、阳光、你自己的床。你在早餐时放声大笑，级长瞪着你。}
# en: Just look
opt.right.label [eee4be] = 只是看看
# en: {You sit on the parapet and watch the whole valley wake, the same as yesterday, the same as tomorrow. From up here the loop looks almost peaceful.|You don't jump. You count every roof in the village instead, and find one more than there should be.}
opt.right.say.1 [a506fc] = {你坐在护墙上，看着整个山谷醒来，和昨天一样，和明天一样。从这上面看，循环几乎是安宁的。|你没跳。你数起了村子里的每一个屋顶，发现比应有的多了一个。}

@event timeloop_dare_kindness
# en: One Perfect Day for a Stranger
title [7ec626] = 给陌生人的完美一天
# en: {There's a shy first-year who eats alone every Tuesday. Today you know everything that will go wrong for them, and you can stop all of it.|The same first-year, the same table. You know their day by heart now.|{flag(loop_perfect_day): You've made this stranger's Tuesday perfect before. You do it again anyway.|You've sat with this stranger before. Today you could do more.}} {They get the juice in the face at ten.|They fail the quiz by one mark.|Someone laughs at their hat.}
text [89afd9] = {有个害羞的一年级生每个星期二都独自吃饭。今天你知道 TA 会遇到的每一件倒霉事，你可以全都阻止。|同一个一年级生，同一张桌子。你现在能背出 TA 的一天了。|{flag(loop_perfect_day): 你已经给这个陌生人过过完美的星期二了。你还是又做了一遍。|你以前陪这个陌生人坐过。今天你可以做得更多。}} {十点钟 TA 会被泼一脸果汁。|TA 的小测差一分不及格。|有人会嘲笑 TA 的帽子。}
# en: A shy first-year in the refectory looking astonished at a slice of cake, a note and a flower appearing one after another in front of them.
scene [62e470] = 膳堂里，一个害羞的一年级生惊讶地看着面前的一块蛋糕，一张字条和一朵花接连出现在 TA 面前。
# en: Make it perfect
opt.left.label [26d75d] = 让它完美
# en: {You move the juice, whisper the quiz answer, compliment the hat and buy them a slice of cake at tea. By evening they're laughing with three new friends. Tomorrow none of it will have happened, except in you.|A perfect day, built carefully, down to the cake you paid for, gone by morning. You don't mind as much as you thought you would.}
opt.left.say.1 [94444f] = {你挪开果汁，悄悄告诉 TA 小测答案，夸了那顶帽子，下午茶时还给 TA 买了块蛋糕。到傍晚，TA 和三个新朋友笑成一团。明天这一切都不会发生过，除了在你心里。|精心搭建的完美一天，连你掏钱买的蛋糕都算在内，到早上就没了。你没有想象中那么在意。}
# en: Just sit with them
opt.right.label [0e1419] = 只是陪 TA 坐坐
# en: {You sit with them at lunch and talk about nothing. They smile once. That one, somehow, you're sure they keep.|An hour of company for someone lonely. It doesn't last. It isn't nothing.}
opt.right.say.1 [bb704c] = {午饭时你和 TA 坐在一起，聊些无关紧要的事。TA 笑了一次。不知怎么，你确信 TA 留住了那一次。|陪一个孤单的人待了一个小时。它不会持久。但它不是什么都没有。}

@event timeloop_clue_bells
# en: The Bells Are Wrong
title [9032a5] = 钟声不对
# en: You spend this Tuesday listening. Every bell in the castle strikes on time, except the astronomy tower's, which strikes a beat late, and then a beat early, as if it's arguing with itself.
text [e09433] = 这个星期二你一直在听。城堡里的每一口钟都准时敲响，只有天文塔的那口，晚了一拍，然后又早了一拍，像在跟自己吵架。
# en: A student counting chimes in a castle stairwell, one hand raised, the great clock face above them stopped between two hours.
scene [bab28b] = 一个学生在城堡楼梯间里数着钟声，一只手举起，头顶巨大的钟面停在两个钟点之间。
# en: Follow the sound up the tower
opt.left.label [d80a5b] = 循着声音爬上塔
# en: Four hundred steps. At the top the door is locked and humming. Through the keyhole, gears turning the wrong way. The morning folds before you can open it.
opt.left.say.1 [350d2d] = 四百级台阶。顶上的门锁着，嗡嗡作响。透过钥匙孔，齿轮正反着转。你还没打开门，早晨就折了起来。
# en: Ask the clockmaster
opt.right.label [2333c1] = 去问钟表师
# en: The clockmaster swears the tower clock is perfect. "The big chronometer up there? Not wound for fifty years." He looks at you oddly. "Unless someone's been at it."
opt.right.say.1 [e028ed] = 钟表师发誓塔钟分毫不差。“上面那台大计时仪？五十年没上过发条了。”他古怪地看了你一眼。“除非有人动过它。”

@event timeloop_clue_light
# en: A Light in the Astronomy Tower
title [762a1b] = 天文塔里的一盏灯
# en: You wake before the eggs this Tuesday and look out of the window. One lamp is burning in the astronomy tower, the only light in the castle. It goes out at the exact moment the morning begins.
text [a928c7] = 这个星期二，你在鸡蛋之前醒来，往窗外看。天文塔里亮着一盏灯，是整座城堡唯一的光。在早晨开始的那一刻，它熄灭了。
# en: A dark astronomy tower at dawn, a single lamp burning in its highest window, a student watching from a courtyard far below.
scene [dcbcd8] = 黎明时分黑暗的天文塔，最高的窗户里亮着一盏孤灯，一个学生在远远的下方庭院里望着。
# en: Be there when it goes out
opt.left.label [84a88b] = 在它熄灭时赶到
# en: You run the stairs in the dark and reach the top as the lamp dies. Someone small is curled by a great brass clock, asleep. Then the morning folds, and you're in bed again, breathless.
opt.left.say.1 [344f2b] = 你在黑暗中冲上楼梯，赶到顶层时灯正好熄灭。一个小小的人蜷在一台巨大的黄铜钟旁边，睡着了。然后早晨折了起来，你又回到了床上，上气不接下气。
# en: Watch the window all night
opt.right.label [b3086c] = 整夜盯着那扇窗
# en: You don't sleep. At three a shadow passes the window: someone small, with a wand. At four the lamp goes out, and so do you.
opt.right.say.1 [e222fc] = 你没睡。三点，一个影子经过窗前：一个小个子，拿着魔杖。四点，灯灭了，你也睡着了。

@event timeloop_clue_firstyear
# en: The Boy Who Dreads Wednesday
title [8239a7] = 害怕星期三的男孩
# en: {There's a first-year who doesn't eat breakfast on Tuesdays. He reads the same page of a textbook over and over. In the margin he's written "one more day".|The boy again, the page again. He's in your dreams now.|You sit down opposite the boy before he can leave.} Tomorrow is his first exam.
text [8e8bda] = {有个一年级生星期二从不吃早饭。他一遍又一遍地读课本的同一页。页边写着“再多一天”。|又是那个男孩，又是那一页。他现在都出现在你梦里了。|你抢在男孩离开之前，坐到了他对面。} 明天是他的第一场考试。
# en: A small first-year hunched over a textbook at breakfast, not eating, a note in the margin reading "one more day".
scene [8ec428] = 早餐桌旁一个瘦小的一年级生弓着背对着课本，一口没吃，页边的字写着“再多一天”。
# en: Ask him about the exam
opt.left.label [68b305] = 问他考试的事
# en: He's terrified of it: if he fails, he goes home. "I wished for one more day," he says, and then looks frightened. "I mean, I just wished." He glances at the astronomy tower without meaning to.
opt.left.say.1 [290d4d] = 他怕极了：如果挂科，他就得回家。“我许愿再多要一天，”他说，然后显得很害怕。“我是说，我只是许了个愿。”他不由自主地瞟了一眼天文塔。
# en: Help him study instead
opt.right.label [99b23b] = 改为帮他复习
# en: You teach him the chapter he's been failing to read. He nearly gets it. He mentions, offhand, the big clock in the astronomy tower, "the one that grants wishes, people say".
opt.right.say.1 [5721a5] = 你给他讲了那一章，他一直读不进去的那一章。他差不多懂了。他随口提到天文塔里的那座大钟，“人们说，能实现愿望的那座”。

@event timeloop_cap
# en: Wednesday, Whether You Like It or Not
title [a038bd] = 不管你喜不喜欢，星期三来了
# en: The loop pulls tight one last time and snaps. Somewhere above, a great clock bursts its springs, and the morning comes in like a wave. It's Wednesday. You feel as if you've run every Tuesday at once.
text [0ed344] = 循环最后一次收紧，然后崩断了。头顶某处，一座大钟的发条迸裂，早晨像潮水一样涌了进来。是星期三了。你觉得自己像是一口气跑完了所有的星期二。
# en: A shattered brass chronometer in a tower room at dawn, springs and gears scattered across the floor, a first-year and a student staring at the wreck.
scene [9c34ea] = 黎明时塔楼房间里一台摔碎的黄铜计时仪，发条和齿轮散落一地，一个一年级生和一个学生呆呆地看着残骸。
# en: Climb the tower to see
opt.left.label [834daa] = 爬上塔去看看
# en: The astronomy tower's chronometer lies in pieces, and a first-year sits among them, white-faced. "I just wanted one more day," he whispers. You sit with him until the clockmaster comes. Your bones ache for a week.
opt.left.say.1 [f85055] = 天文塔的计时仪碎成了一地，一个一年级生坐在碎片中间，脸色煞白。“我只是想再多要一天，”他低声说。你陪他坐着，直到钟表师赶来。你的骨头疼了一个星期。
# en: Go back to bed
opt.right.label [ef6924] = 回去睡觉
# en: You sleep through Wednesday's breakfast, and it is the best sleep of your life. When you wake, nobody remembers anything, and you remember all of it.
opt.right.say.1 [684fad] = 你睡过了星期三的早餐，这是你这辈子睡得最好的一觉。醒来时，谁都不记得任何事，而你全都记得。

@event timeloop_after
# en: Only You Remember
title [bfd163] = 只有你记得
# en: Weeks later, the Tuesdays still visit you in dreams. {loop_exploit >= 2: People remember your winning streak, though not why, and some of them have stopped betting with you.|Nobody else remembers anything.} You remember the eggs, the bells, the same morning over and over. You could tell someone, if you wanted.
text [623b3d] = 几个星期后，那些星期二还会在梦里来找你。{loop_exploit >= 2: 人们记得你的连胜，虽然不记得原因，有些人已经不跟你打赌了。|别人什么都不记得。} 你记得那些鸡蛋、那些钟声，同一个早晨一遍又一遍。如果你愿意，可以告诉某个人。
# en: A student alone at a window seat on an ordinary morning, a cup of tea going cold, a clock on the wall ticking forward at last.
scene [236d1b] = 一个寻常的早晨，一个学生独自坐在窗边座位上，一杯茶渐渐凉了，墙上的钟终于向前走着。
# en: Tell one person the truth
opt.left.label [f50d5d] = 把真相告诉一个人
# en: You tell a friend everything over tea. They don't believe a word and believe all of it. At the end they ask, gently, whether you gave back the winnings. You didn't. It weighs, a little.
opt.left.say.1 [476b55] = 你在喝茶时把一切都告诉了一个朋友。对方一个字都不信，又全都信了。最后，对方温和地问你有没有把赢来的钱还回去。你没有。这让你心里有点沉。
# en: You tell a friend everything over tea. They don't believe a word and believe all of it. {seen(timeloop_dare_kindness) > 0: At the end they say, "So you were kind to a stranger, again and again, and nobody knew." You nod. "Sounds like you," they say.|At the end they say, "So you lived one day over and over, and nobody knew." You nod. "Sounds exhausting," they say.}
opt.left.say.2 [a330bb] = 你在喝茶时把一切都告诉了一个朋友。对方一个字都不信，又全都信了。{seen(timeloop_dare_kindness) > 0: 最后对方说：“所以你一次又一次地对一个陌生人好，而没人知道。”你点点头。“听起来像你，”对方说。|最后对方说：“所以你把同一天过了一遍又一遍，而没人知道。”你点点头。“听起来就累，”对方说。}
# en: Keep it to yourself
opt.right.label [09de43] = 埋在心里
# en: You keep it. Some mornings you catch a phrase you once said in a loop, and the person you say it to looks at you as if they almost remember. They never quite do.
opt.right.say.1 [0e7b0c] = 你留着它。有些早上，你会脱口说出某句曾在循环里说过的话，听的人看着你，像是差一点就想起来了。但他们从来没有真正想起。
